column7:
At a time when the consulting landscape is more competitive than ever, Talan set ambitious growth plans and embarked on a digital transformation journey in the cloud. By implementing SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition, Talan has unlocked process efficiencies and granular data for decision-making, putting it in a strong position to sustain global growth.
Go-Live: 17-01-2025;
Implementation Partner: PASAPAS
Why Public Cloud: Harmonize finance operations and cost accounting practices across group entities as well as streamline the procure-to-pay process from purchase request to purchase payment; multiple languages; quick integration with fit-to-standard approach;
Project length: 6 months;
OCS and video available in links;
